{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "electricity-bill-generator-api",
		"name": "Electricity Bill Generator API",
		"description": "Complete collection for testing the Electricity Bill Generator API. Includes authentication, customer management, billing, meter readings, admin functions, and data seeding tools.\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Start MySQL server and create database `elec_bill`\n2. Start the Spring Boot application: `./mvnw spring-boot:run`\n3. Import this collection into Postman\n4. Set the environment variables:\n   - `baseUrl`: http://localhost:8080/api\n   - `userToken`: (will be set automatically after login)\n   - `adminToken`: (will be set automatically after admin login)\n   - `customerId`: (will be set automatically after registration)\n\n## Quick Start with Data Seeding:\n1. Register an admin user\n2. Login as admin to get admin token\n3. Use 'Debug > Seed Test Data' to create sample customers with historical data\n4. Test all endpoints with pre-populated data\n\n## Test Credentials (after seeding):\n- Customer: user.a@example.com / password123\n- Customer: user.b@example.com / password123\n- Customer: user.c@example.com / password123\n\n## Test Flow:\n1. Register a new customer or admin\n2. Login to get appropriate token\n3. Use data seeding endpoints for quick testing\n4. Test all endpoints with sample data",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔓 Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register Customer",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const responseJson = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('customerId', responseJson.id);",
									"    pm.test('Customer registered successfully', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('id');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('email');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson.role).to.eql('ROLE_USER');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"address\": \"123 Main Street, City\",\n  \"phone\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"customerType\": \"RESIDENTIAL\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"register"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login Customer",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const responseJson = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('userToken', responseJson.token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('customerId', responseJson.customer.id);",
									"    pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('token');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('customer');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson.customer.role).to.eql('ROLE_USER');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login Admin",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const responseJson = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('adminToken', responseJson.token);",
									"    pm.test('Admin login successful', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('token');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson).to.have.property('customer');",
									"        pm.expect(responseJson.customer.role).to.eql('ROLE_ADMIN');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@electricitybill.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
